# Scenario 'mail_receive_many': おくる/うけとる with FOURTEEN short mails on the fake POP3 server (mail_many01..14: alternating ASCII and ISO-2022-JP).
# The mailbox holds twelve mails, so the receive loop stops when it is full (D62E + count == 12) and two mails stay on the server: the round-1 runs
# received at most four mails and never reached the "12 or more" count sprite (29:MailResult_SetReceivedSprite), the twelve object rows chosen by the
# received count (26:4C94 / 26:4DAB), the scroll arrows of a list longer than the window (25:Mailbox_UpdateScrollArrows) or a full mailbox.
# After the session the mailbox list opens by itself; it is scrolled down (wrapping at the end) and up, a mail is read, and receive is tried once
# more with the mailbox full. Starts from the state left by 'mail_send' (outbox empty, empty mailbox). Screen names = my reading of the screenshots.
wait 400                     # boot
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A                        # title "スタート"
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # top menu: メール
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # おくる/うけとる
waitstable 60 max 300
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # はい
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # "0でつうしんをはじめる"
waitstable 60 max 300
wait 1500
shot receiving_1
wait 3000
shot receiving_2
waitstable 120 max 8000
shot comm_finished
tap A                        # dismiss
waitstable 60 max 600
shot result_1
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot result_2
tap A                        # after the result screens the mailbox list opens by itself
waitstable 60 max 600
shot list
tap DOWN x3
wait 100
shot list_down_3
tap DOWN x3
wait 100
tap DOWN x3
wait 100
tap DOWN x3
wait 100
shot list_wrapped
tap UP x3
wait 100
shot list_up_3
tap UP x4
wait 100
tap A
wait 60
tap A                        # icon bar: first icon = read
waitstable 60 max 600
shot sender
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot back_in_list
tap B                        # to the mail menu
waitstable 60 max 600
shot mail_menu
# --- receive again with the mailbox full (two mails are still on the server)
tap UP x8
wait 30
tap A                        # おくる/うけとる
waitstable 60 max 300
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 300
wait 2500
shot full_again_1
waitstable 120 max 4000
shot full_again_2
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot full_again_3
